Ticket **#4471** was marked known as one parser bug. The export shows **two causes** merged into that ticket.

## Problems

1. **parser** — **379** reports. Day-first tenants; the shared parser reads month first, so bookings land on the wrong day.
2. **hint** — **33** reports. Day-first tenants on **booking-v3**: the form prints `MM/DD/YYYY` while it still reads day first. That is a different bug from the shared parser.

Five more reports were footnoted as a one-day move; by tenant they still sit under `parser`, not a third cause.

<Callout>
Split #4471: one ticket per cause. Counts from unique report ids in the export (412 total).
</Callout>

